      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>“Tkhine of the Matriarchs for the New Moon of Tishrei [Rosh Hashanah]” by Rebbetsin Seril Rappaport is a faithful transcription of her tkhine included in “תחנה אמהות מן ראש חודש אלול” (Tkhine of the Matriarchs for the New Moon of Elul) published in Vilna, 1874, as re-published in <tei:hi rend="italic">The Merit of Our Mothers</tei:hi> בזכות אמהות <tei:hi rend="italic">A Bilingual Anthology of Jewish Women’s Prayers</tei:hi>, compiled by Rabbi Tracy Guren Klirs, Cincinnati: Hebrew Union College Press, 1992. <tei:hi rend="italic">shgiyot mi yavin, ministarot nakeni.</tei:hi> The translation above is lightly adapted from that which appears there.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
      <j:endConditional target="#osp_14045_notes"/>
